# N3 example: negation.
# Companion to negation.eye/.srl: negation as failure.

@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.
@prefix : <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyepl/examples/negation#>.

:alice a :Person.
:bob a :Person.
:bob a :Blocked.

{?x a :Person. ?SCOPE log:notIncludes {?x a :Blocked}.} => {?x a :Eligible}.
